        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: T. Arthur Cottam, William Shakespeare\n- Works: Othello\n- Organizations: Valley Theatre League, Zombie Joe's Underground Theatre Group\n- Topics: Theatre awards, Theatre productions\n\nFacts:\n- William Shakespeare wrote the tragedy \"Othello\" (\"The Tragedy of Othello, the Moor of Venice\"), and it is believed to have been written in 1603.\n- T. Arthur Cottam acted in theatre.\n- T. Arthur Cottam received an Artistic Director Achievement Award from the Valley Theatre League for his role in the theatre production \"Othello.\"\n- T. Arthur Cottam was a cast member of Zombie Joe's Underground Theatre Group in the production \"Othello.\"",
